WEBVTT

00:09.143 --> 00:10.511
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.544 --> 00:12.446
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.480 --> 00:14.048
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:14.082 --> 00:15.649
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.683 --> 00:18.819
* OH...
* 哦...

00:18.852 --> 00:21.089
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:21.122 --> 00:23.057
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:23.091 --> 00:25.193
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.226 --> 00:26.827
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.860 --> 00:29.197
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:29.230 --> 00:30.531
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.564 --> 00:33.234
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.267 --> 00:35.103
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:35.136 --> 00:37.071
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:37.105 --> 00:40.074
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.108 --> 00:41.075
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:41.109 --> 00:43.277
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:43.311 --> 00:45.146
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.179 --> 00:49.217
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.250 --> 00:51.285
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:02.863 --> 01:06.200
Squidward:
HURRY UP WITH THOSE
CHAIRS, SPONGEBOB!
章鱼哥：
快点处理那些
椅子，海绵宝宝！

01:06.234 --> 01:07.335
IT'S AFTER CLOSING
这是关闭后的情况

01:07.368 --> 01:09.603
AND I'D LIKE TO GO HOME.
我想回家。

01:09.637 --> 01:11.305
( phone rings )
（电话铃声响起）

01:11.339 --> 01:12.340
I GOT IT.
我得到了它。

01:12.373 --> 01:14.308
I GOT IT! COMING!
我得到了它！未来！

01:14.342 --> 01:15.276
HELLO.
你好。

01:15.309 --> 01:17.145
SORRY, SIR,
WE'RE CLOSED.
对不起，先生，
我们关门了。

01:17.178 --> 01:18.212
AHOY, THERE!
啊哈，在那里！

01:18.246 --> 01:20.248
KRUSTY KRAB--
HOW CAN I HELP YOU?
脆皮蟹——
我能为您提供什么帮助？

01:20.281 --> 01:22.416
PIZZA?
OF COURSE WE HAVE PIZZA.
比萨？
我们当然有披萨。

01:22.450 --> 01:23.751
UH, MR. KRAB...
呃，先生。蟹...

01:23.784 --> 01:26.454
OUR DELIVERY SQUID
WILL BRING IT
RIGHT OVER.
我们的外送鱿鱼
会带来它
马上结束。

01:26.487 --> 01:29.490
MR. KRAB, WE DON'T SERVE PIZZA.
先生。甲蟹，我们不提供披萨。

01:33.394 --> 01:34.795
WE DON'T DELIVER.
我们不送货。

01:34.828 --> 01:39.400
WE DON'T DELIVER,
BUT Y DO.
我们不送货，
但是你会的。

01:39.433 --> 01:41.835
CAN'T YOU JUST GET
SPONGEBOB TO DO IT?
你不能得到吗
海绵宝宝要这么做吗？

01:41.869 --> 01:43.304
GREAT IDEA!
好主意！

01:43.337 --> 01:44.405
TAKE HIM WITH YOU.
带上他。

01:46.307 --> 01:49.177
THAT'S NOT
WHAT I HAD IN MIND.
那不是
我的想法。

01:49.577 --> 01:51.379
FRONT END, CHECK.
前端，检查。

01:51.412 --> 01:54.382
ANTENNA... CHECK.
天线...检查。

01:54.415 --> 01:56.217
BUMPER... CHECK.
保险杠...检查。

01:56.250 --> 01:59.420
BUMPER... STICKER-- CHECK.
保险杠...贴纸——检查。

02:03.191 --> 02:05.526
( in high voice ):
TIRE PRESSURE...
（高声）：
轮胎压力...

02:05.559 --> 02:10.864
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

02:13.267 --> 02:14.402
CHECK.
查看。

02:14.435 --> 02:16.204
VEHICLE INSPECTION COMPLETE.
车辆检查完成。

02:16.237 --> 02:18.572
WE'RE REALLY MAKING HISTORY
HERE, SQUIDWARD.
我们正在真正创造历史
在这里，章鱼哥。

02:18.606 --> 02:20.541
THAT LUCKY CUSTOMER
IS GOING TO GET
那个幸运的顾客
将会得到

02:20.574 --> 02:22.543
THE FIRST KRABBY
PATTY PIZZA EVER!
第一只蟹蟹
永远的帕蒂披萨！

02:22.576 --> 02:24.878
GOOD, THEN YOU DRIVE.
好，那你开车吧。

02:24.912 --> 02:27.381
I CAN'T-- I'M STILL
IN BOATING SCHOOL.
我不能——我仍然
在划船学校。

02:27.415 --> 02:30.551
COME ON, SPONGEBOB,
IT'S JUST AROUND THE CORNER.
来吧，海绵宝宝，
就在拐角处。

02:30.584 --> 02:32.386
WELL, YEAH, BUT...
嗯，是的，但是……

02:32.420 --> 02:34.655
JUST DO WHAT YOU DO IN SCHOOL.
做你在学校做的事。

02:34.688 --> 02:36.324
WELL, OKAY...
嗯，好吧……

02:37.525 --> 02:39.593
WAIT, DON'T TELL ME.
等等，别告诉我。

02:39.627 --> 02:40.794
BACK IT UP.
备份。

02:40.828 --> 02:41.795
HUH?
嗯？

02:41.829 --> 02:43.664
BACK IT UP.
备份。

02:43.697 --> 02:45.899
RIGHT-- BACK IT UP.
正确——支持它。

02:45.933 --> 02:46.967
( gears grinding )
（齿轮磨削）

02:47.000 --> 02:48.269
( moans )
（呻吟声）

02:48.302 --> 02:49.703
BACK IT UP!
支持它！

02:49.737 --> 02:50.904
OKAY, OKAY.
好吧，好吧。

02:50.938 --> 02:54.408
SHIFT INTO REVERSE,
SPONGEBOB.
换至倒档，
海绵宝宝。

02:54.442 --> 02:55.743
REVERSE--
OH, YEAH, REVERSE.
反向--
哦，是的，反过来。

02:55.776 --> 02:56.877
HUH?
嗯？

02:58.379 --> 03:01.915
BACK IT UP!
支持它！

03:01.949 --> 03:03.317
BACK IT UP!
支持它！

03:03.351 --> 03:04.485
( tires squealing )
（轮胎吱吱作响）

03:04.518 --> 03:06.254
GIVE ME THE WHEEL,
SPONGEBOB.
给我方向盘，
海绵宝宝。

03:06.287 --> 03:07.455
GIVE ME THE WHEEL!
把方向盘给我！

03:07.488 --> 03:08.689
BACKING UP,
BACKING UP...
备份，
正在备份...

03:08.722 --> 03:12.760
( voice jiggling ):
BACK... ING... UP!
（声音颤抖）：
后退……前进！

03:12.793 --> 03:16.564
( both yelling )
（两人都大喊大叫）

03:16.597 --> 03:19.567
SpongeBob:
BACKING UP, BACKING UP.
海绵宝宝：
备份，备份。

03:19.600 --> 03:21.802
BACKING UP, BACKING UP.
备份，备份。

03:21.835 --> 03:23.771
( engine clanks and backfires )
（发动机叮当声和逆火）

03:23.804 --> 03:25.673
BACKING UP.
备份。

03:25.706 --> 03:28.409
WELL, YOU BACKED UP.
好吧，你备份了。

03:28.442 --> 03:29.943
AND YOU KNOW WHAT?
你知道吗？

03:29.977 --> 03:32.380
I THINK
WE'RE OUT OF GAS.
我认为
我们没油了。

03:32.413 --> 03:34.282
AND YOU KNOW WHAT ELSE?
你知道还有什么吗？

03:34.315 --> 03:37.485
WE'RE IN THE MIDDLE OF NOWHERE!
我们正处在一个偏僻的地方！

03:37.518 --> 03:40.354
AND YOU KNOW
WHAT ELSE ELSE?
你知道
还有什么？

03:40.388 --> 03:43.424
I THINK THE PIZZA'S
GETTING COLD.
我认为披萨的
变冷了。

03:43.457 --> 03:46.294
AND THE PIZZA'S COLD!
披萨冷了！

03:46.327 --> 03:48.396
OH, THE PIZZA'S COLD.
哦，披萨冷了。

03:48.429 --> 03:50.664
NOT THE PIZZA!
不是披萨！

03:50.698 --> 03:53.567
OH, HOW COULD IT GET ANY WORSE?
哦，情况还能变得更糟吗？

04:00.541 --> 04:04.878
WELL, WE CAN STILL
DELIVER IT ON FOOT.
好吧，我们仍然可以
步行送货。

04:04.912 --> 04:06.013
Squidward:
* OW, OW, OW
章鱼哥：
* 哦，哦，哦

04:06.046 --> 04:07.415
SpongeBob:
* THE KRUSTY KRAB PIZZA
海绵宝宝：
* 脆皮蟹披萨

04:07.448 --> 04:09.016
* IS THE PIZZA
* OW, OW, OW
* 是披萨
* 哦，哦，哦

04:09.049 --> 04:10.484
* FOR YOU AND ME
* OW, OW, OW
* 为了你和我
* 哦，哦，哦

04:10.518 --> 04:12.420
* THE KRUSTY
KRAB PIZZA *
* OW, OW, OW
* 克鲁斯蒂
蟹肉披萨 *
* 哦，哦，哦

04:12.453 --> 04:13.787
* IS THE PIZZA
* OW, OW, OW
* 是披萨
* 哦，哦，哦

04:13.821 --> 04:16.056
* AND MY FEET ARE KILLING ME.
* 我的脚快要死了。

04:16.089 --> 04:17.558
( groans )
（呻吟）

04:17.591 --> 04:19.993
SPONGEBOB,
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
海绵宝宝，
你在做什么？

04:20.027 --> 04:21.595
IT'S AN OLD PIONEER TRICK.
这是一个古老的先驱技巧。

04:21.629 --> 04:23.364
I SAW IT IN A MOVIE ONCE.
我在电影里看过一次。

04:23.397 --> 04:25.566
SPONGEBOB,
THIS IS NO TIME FOR...
海绵宝宝，
现在不是……的时间

04:25.599 --> 04:27.768
SHH! IT'S WORKING!
嘘！它正在工作！

04:27.801 --> 04:29.337
WHAT IS IT?
它是什么？

04:29.370 --> 04:31.472
TRUCK! 16 WHEELS!
卡车！ 16 个轮子！

04:31.505 --> 04:33.441
( engine rumbling )
（发动机轰鸣）

04:33.474 --> 04:34.475
NOW I CAN SHOW YOU
现在我可以向你展示

04:34.508 --> 04:36.344
HOW THE PIONEERS
HITCHHIKED.
先驱者如何
搭便车。

04:36.377 --> 04:44.418
( whooping and hollering )
（欢呼声和叫喊声）

04:44.452 --> 04:46.787
( spoons rattling )
（勺子嘎嘎作响）

04:46.820 --> 04:49.623
( whooping )
（呼喊）

04:50.491 --> 04:52.793
CRASHIN', FRASHIN' BREAK DANCER!
疯狂、疯狂的霹雳舞者！

04:52.826 --> 04:53.927
( horn blasts )
（喇叭声）

04:53.961 --> 04:56.397
HE'S STOPPING, HE'S STOPPING.
他要停下来，他要停下来。

04:56.430 --> 04:57.465
( honking )
（按喇叭）

05:02.603 --> 05:06.073
* THE KRUSTY KRAB PIZZA
IS THE PIZZA FOR YOU AND ME *
* 脆皮蟹披萨
适合你和我的披萨 *

05:06.106 --> 05:10.944
* THE KRUSTY KRAB PIZZA
IS THE PIZZA WE DELIVER-Y *
* 脆皮蟹披萨
我们提供的是披萨吗 *

05:10.978 --> 05:15.549
* THE KRUSTY KRAB PIZZA
IS THE PIZZA VERY TASTY. *
* 脆皮蟹披萨
披萨很好吃吗？ *

05:19.653 --> 05:22.856
WILL YOU LET GO
OF THAT STUPID PIZZA ALREADY?
你会放手吗
已经吃过那个愚蠢的披萨了吗？

05:22.890 --> 05:23.857
I CAN'T!
我不能！

05:23.891 --> 05:25.526
IT'S FOR
THE CUSTOMER!
这是为了
客户！

05:25.559 --> 05:27.561
WHO CARES ABOUT THE CUSTOMER?
谁关心客户？

05:27.595 --> 05:28.629
I DO!
我愿意！

05:28.662 --> 05:30.564
WELL, I DON'T!
好吧，我不！

05:30.598 --> 05:31.499
( gasps )
（喘气）

05:31.532 --> 05:32.566
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

05:32.600 --> 05:34.902
LET GO OF THAT PIZZA!
放开那个披萨！

05:34.935 --> 05:35.836
NO!
不！

05:35.869 --> 05:37.104
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

05:37.137 --> 05:38.138
OW!
噢！

05:38.171 --> 05:39.707
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

05:39.740 --> 05:41.609
LET GO OF THE PIZZA.
放开披萨。

05:41.642 --> 05:43.777
NO! IT'S FOR THE CUSTOMER.
不！为客户服务。

05:43.811 --> 05:45.746
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

05:47.448 --> 05:50.050
LET GO OF THE PIZZA!
放开披萨吧！

05:50.083 --> 05:51.552
WHOA!
哇啊！

05:51.585 --> 05:52.820
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

05:52.853 --> 05:54.622
( Squidward yelling )
（章鱼哥大喊）

05:54.655 --> 05:57.891
HANG ON TO THE PIZZA!
坚持吃披萨！

05:58.792 --> 06:02.530
( both yelling )
（两人都大喊大叫）

06:03.697 --> 06:05.933
( Squidward grunts )
（章鱼哥咕哝）

06:06.900 --> 06:08.402
HEY... HEY!
嘿...嘿！

06:08.436 --> 06:10.604
WH-WHERE'S THE ROAD?
路在哪里？

06:10.638 --> 06:13.441
WH-WHERE'S THE ROAD?
路在哪里？

06:13.474 --> 06:14.575
WE'RE DOOMED!
我们完蛋了！

06:14.608 --> 06:16.143
OH, HOW ARE WE GOING
TO GET HOME?
哦，我们怎么样
回家？

06:16.176 --> 06:17.177
WHICH WAY DO WE GO?
我们该走哪条路？

06:17.210 --> 06:18.679
WHAT ARE WE
GOING TO DO NOW?
我们是什么
现在要做吗？

06:18.712 --> 06:19.880
THERE'S NO ROAD HERE.
这里没有路。

06:19.913 --> 06:23.016
I THINK TOWN'S THIS WAY.
我想小镇就是这样的。

06:23.050 --> 06:24.685
OH, DON'T TELL ME, JETHRO.
哦，别告诉我，杰思罗。

06:24.718 --> 06:25.686
THE PIONEERS?
先驱者？

06:25.719 --> 06:26.854
THAT'S RIGHT.
这是正确的。

06:26.887 --> 06:29.022
MOSS ALWAYS POINTS
TO CIVILIZATION.
莫斯总是指出
走向文明。

06:29.056 --> 06:31.425
THAT WAY?
THAT WAY THERE?
那样？
在那儿？

06:31.459 --> 06:33.594
SO, LET ME GET
THIS STRAIGHT.
那么，让我得到
这直。

06:33.627 --> 06:36.564
YOU THINK THAT WE
SHOULD GO THAT WAY?
你以为我们
应该那样做吗？

06:36.597 --> 06:37.631
YEP.
是的。

06:37.665 --> 06:39.199
WELL, THEN I'M
GOING THIS WAY.
好吧，那我就是
往这边走。

06:39.232 --> 06:40.634
HUH?
嗯？

06:40.668 --> 06:41.735
SQUID! WAIT!
乌贼！等待！

06:41.769 --> 06:44.538
TRUST ME, I KNOW
WHERE I'M GOING.
相信我，我知道
我要去哪里。

06:46.674 --> 06:48.108
* THE KRUSTY KRAB
PIZZA *
* 脆皮蟹
披萨 *

06:48.141 --> 06:50.844
* IS THE PIZZA
ABSOLUTIVALLY! *
* 是披萨
绝对！ *

06:50.878 --> 06:52.480
( mouthing percussion )
（口型打击乐）

06:52.513 --> 06:53.346
* PIZZA...
* 比萨...

06:53.380 --> 06:56.517
( mouthing
drum sounds )
（张嘴
鼓声）

06:56.550 --> 06:58.586
* PIZZA...
* 比萨...

07:00.220 --> 07:05.659
( with soul ):
* KRUSTY KRAB...
（有灵魂）：
* 蟹堡王...

07:05.693 --> 07:06.860
* PIZZA
* 比萨

07:06.894 --> 07:09.062
* IS THE PIZZA, YEAH
* 是披萨，是的

07:09.096 --> 07:11.031
* FOR YOU AND...
* 为您和...

07:11.064 --> 07:15.135
* ME!
* 我！

07:16.770 --> 07:18.806
( hoarsely ):
* KRAB... PIZZA
（沙哑地）：
* 甲蟹...披萨

07:18.839 --> 07:21.041
* FOR... YOU...
* 为你...

07:22.175 --> 07:27.080
( mumbling incoherently )
（语无伦次地咕哝）

07:32.786 --> 07:37.090
SPONGE, WE'VE GOT
TO EAT SOMETHING.
海绵，我们有
吃点东西。

07:37.124 --> 07:39.159
I HEARD IN TIMES
OF HARDSHIP
我有时听说
苦难的

07:39.192 --> 07:41.261
THE PIONEERS
WOULD EAT CORAL.
先驱者
会吃珊瑚。

07:41.294 --> 07:43.964
( gobbling )
（狼吞虎咽）

07:43.997 --> 07:45.966
NO, MAYBE
IT WASN'T CORAL.
不，也许
这不是珊瑚。

07:45.999 --> 07:47.000
( spitting )
（吐口水）

07:47.034 --> 07:48.969
MAYBE IT WAS SAND;
NO, NO-- MUD.
也许是沙子；也许是沙子。
不，不——泥巴。

07:49.002 --> 07:49.937
GIVE ME THE PIZZA!
把披萨给我！

07:49.970 --> 07:52.540
WAIT, I REMEMBER NOW--
IT WAS CORAL!
等等，我现在想起来了——
那是珊瑚！

07:52.573 --> 07:53.173
GIVE IT TO ME!
把它给我！

07:53.206 --> 07:54.274
NO! WE PROMISED
不！我们承诺

07:54.307 --> 07:55.876
IT'S FOR THE CUSTOMER.
为客户服务。

07:55.909 --> 07:58.679
YOU'RE RIGHT,
IT'S FOR THE CUSTOMER.
你是对的，
为客户服务。

07:58.712 --> 07:59.780
YEAH.
是的。

07:59.813 --> 08:02.015
MAYBE WE BETTER
CHECK ON IT--
也许我们更好
检查一下——

08:02.049 --> 08:03.951
MAKE SURE IT'S OKAY.
确保没问题。

08:03.984 --> 08:04.985
WELL...
出色地...

08:05.018 --> 08:06.787
JUST A PEEK.
只是一瞥。

08:06.820 --> 08:07.721
OKAY, IT'S FINE.
好吧，没问题。

08:07.755 --> 08:09.657
NO, I THINK
I SAW SOMETHING.
不，我认为
我看到了一些东西。

08:10.691 --> 08:11.692
OH...
哦...

08:11.725 --> 08:13.794
NO-- I WAS WRONG.
不——我错了。

08:13.827 --> 08:14.928
LOOKS OKAY.
看起来还不错。

08:14.962 --> 08:18.198
SURE IS
A FINE-LOOKING PIZZA.
当然是
看起来很漂亮的披萨。

08:18.231 --> 08:19.600
YEAH!
是的！

08:19.633 --> 08:20.734
WHAT'S THAT?
那是什么？

08:20.768 --> 08:22.803
IS THAT THE CHEESE?
那是奶酪吗？

08:22.836 --> 08:24.137
( dreamily ):
YEAH...
（如梦似幻）：
是啊...

08:24.171 --> 08:26.674
AND THE PEPPERONI?
还有意大利辣香肠？

08:26.707 --> 08:27.708
YEAH...
是的...

08:27.741 --> 08:30.277
OH, LOOKS GOOD, HUH?
哦，看起来不错吧？

08:31.745 --> 08:33.614
WAIT A SECOND!
等一下！

08:33.647 --> 08:36.650
I KNOW WHAT YOU'RE
TRYING TO DO, SQUIDWARD.
我知道你是什么
努力去做，章鱼哥。

08:36.684 --> 08:38.251
I'M NOT LETTING YOU
EAT THE PIZZA!
我不会让你
吃披萨！

08:38.285 --> 08:39.587
GIVE ME THAT PIZZA!
把披萨给我！

08:39.620 --> 08:40.821
NO!
不！

08:40.854 --> 08:43.190
DON'T MAKE ME TAKE IT
AWAY FROM YOU, SPONGEBOB.
别让我接受
远离你，海绵宝宝。

08:43.223 --> 08:44.925
GET AWAY!
逃离！

08:44.958 --> 08:46.727
GET BACK HERE, SPONGEBOB.
回到这里，海绵宝宝。

08:46.760 --> 08:48.161
GIVE ME THAT PIZZA!
把披萨给我！

08:48.195 --> 08:49.529
NO!
不！

08:50.263 --> 08:51.699
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

08:51.732 --> 08:53.233
NO!
不！

08:53.266 --> 08:55.636
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

08:55.669 --> 08:56.737
NO!
不！

08:56.770 --> 08:59.873
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

08:59.907 --> 09:01.174
WAIT.
等待。

09:01.208 --> 09:03.677
NO!
不！

09:03.711 --> 09:04.745
NO!
不！

09:04.778 --> 09:06.113
I WANT THAT PIZZA
我想要那个披萨

09:06.146 --> 09:08.148
AND YOU'RE GOING
TO HAND IT OVER
你要去
移交它

09:08.181 --> 09:09.182
ONE WAY OR ANOTHER.
不管怎样。

09:09.216 --> 09:11.652
LOOK, WE'RE SAVED!
看，我们得救了！

09:11.685 --> 09:12.786
SURE, WE'RE SAVED.
当然，我们得救了。

09:12.820 --> 09:14.121
NOW GIVE ME SOME PIZZA!
现在给我一些披萨！

09:14.154 --> 09:15.355
NO, REALLY, SQUID.
不，真的，鱿鱼。

09:15.388 --> 09:16.323
WE'RE SAVED!
我们得救了！

09:16.356 --> 09:19.026
WE'RE SAVED!
WE'RE SAVED!
我们得救了！
我们得救了！

09:19.059 --> 09:21.028
WILL YOU CUT THAT OUT!
你能把它剪掉吗？

09:21.061 --> 09:22.830
( to a conga beat ):
* SAVED, SAVED
（康加舞节拍）：
* 已保存，已保存

09:22.863 --> 09:24.598
* SAVED, SAVED
* 已保存，已保存

09:24.632 --> 09:25.599
* SAVED, SAVED
* 已保存，已保存

09:25.633 --> 09:26.634
* SAVED, SAVED
* 已保存，已保存

09:26.667 --> 09:28.101
* SAVED, SAVED, SAVED, SAVED,
SAVED, SAVED *
* 已保存，已保存，已保存，已保存，
已保存，已保存 *

09:28.135 --> 09:29.803
* SAVED, SAVED,
SAVED, SAVED,
SAVED, SAVED *
* 已保存，已保存，
已保存，已保存，
已保存，已保存 *

09:29.837 --> 09:31.705
* SAVED, SAVED, SAVED,
SAVED, SAVED, SAVED *
* 已保存，已保存，已保存，
已保存，已保存，已保存*

09:31.739 --> 09:32.940
* SAVED, WE ARE SAVED.
* 得救了，我们得救了。

09:32.973 --> 09:35.843
THAT'S JUST A STUPID BOULDER.
那只是一块愚蠢的巨石。

09:35.876 --> 09:38.078
IT'S NOT JUST A BOULDER...
这不仅仅是一块巨石......

09:38.111 --> 09:39.179
( sniffles )
（抽鼻子）

09:39.212 --> 09:39.980
IT'S A ROCK.
这是一块岩石。

09:40.013 --> 09:42.082
( sobbing ):
A ROCK!
（抽泣）：
一块石头！

09:42.115 --> 09:45.052
A ROCK!
一块石头！

09:46.386 --> 09:51.324
IT'S A BIG,
BEAUTIFUL OLD ROCK.
它很大，
美丽的古老岩石。

09:51.358 --> 09:54.895
OH, THE PIONEERS
USED TO RIDE THESE
BABIES FOR MILES
哦，开拓者们
曾经骑过这些
婴儿的里程

09:54.928 --> 09:56.263
AND IT'S IN GREAT SHAPE.
而且状态极佳。

09:56.296 --> 09:57.765
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

09:57.798 --> 10:00.300
WILL YOU FORGET
THE STUPID PIONEERS?
你会忘记吗
愚蠢的先驱者？

10:00.333 --> 10:03.671
HAVE YOU EVER NOTICED THAT
THERE ARE NONE OF THEM LEFT?
你有没有注意到
他们都没有留下了吗？

10:03.704 --> 10:06.874
THAT'S BECAUSE THEY WERE
LOUSY HITCHHIKERS, ATE CORAL
那是因为他们是
糟糕的搭便车者吃了珊瑚

10:06.907 --> 10:08.976
AND TOOK DIRECTIONS FROM ALGAE!
并从藻类那里得到指示！

10:09.009 --> 10:13.847
AND NOW YOU'RE TELLING ME
THEY THOUGHT THEY COULD DRIVE...
现在你告诉我
他们认为自己可以开车……

10:14.347 --> 10:15.315
ROCKS.
岩石。

10:15.348 --> 10:17.284
HOLD ON, THERE, JETHRO!
坚持住，杰思罗！

10:19.419 --> 10:21.188
I CAN'T WAIT
TO SEE THE LOOK
我等不及了
看看外观

10:21.221 --> 10:22.890
ON OUR CUSTOMER'S FACE.
在我们客户的脸上。

10:24.391 --> 10:25.959
( doorbell rings )
（门铃响了）

10:26.459 --> 10:27.394
YEAH?
是的？

10:27.427 --> 10:28.729
CONGRATULATIONS, SIR.
恭喜你，先生。

10:28.762 --> 10:30.831
YOUR KRABBY PATTY PIZZA'S HERE.
您的蟹肉饼披萨来了。

10:30.864 --> 10:31.865
WOW! THANKS!
哇！谢谢！

10:31.899 --> 10:33.767
I'VE BEEN DYING
FOR ONE OF THESE.
我快死了
对于其中之一。

10:33.801 --> 10:35.068
IT... WHERE'S MY DRINK?
它...我的饮料呢？

10:35.102 --> 10:37.237
WHAT DRINK?
喝什么？

10:37.270 --> 10:38.806
MY DRINK!
我的饮料！

10:38.839 --> 10:40.407
MY DIET DR. KELP!
我的饮食博士。海带！

10:40.440 --> 10:42.910
DON'T TELL ME
YOU FORGOT MY DRINK!
别告诉我
你忘了我的饮料！

10:42.943 --> 10:44.912
BUT YOU DIDN'T ORDER ANY...
但你没有订购任何...

10:44.945 --> 10:48.882
HOW AM I SUPPOSED TO EAT
THIS PIZZA WITHOUT MY DRINK?!
我应该怎么吃
这个披萨没有我的饮料？！

10:48.916 --> 10:49.817
BUT... BUT...
但是...但是...

10:49.850 --> 10:52.152
DIDN'T YOU
EVER ONCE THINK
OF THE CUSTOMER?
你不是吗？
曾经想过
客户的？

10:52.185 --> 10:54.855
YOU CALL YOURSELF
A DELIVERY BOY?
你称自己为
送货员？

10:54.888 --> 10:55.956
WELL, I AIN'T BUYING!
好吧，我不买！

10:55.989 --> 10:57.324
( door slams )
（关门声）

10:57.357 --> 10:58.692
SPONGE?
海绵？

11:00.060 --> 11:01.929
SPONGE?
海绵？

11:01.962 --> 11:03.731
IT'S OKAY.
没关系。

11:03.764 --> 11:05.265
SPONGE...
海绵...

11:06.133 --> 11:07.835
( wheezes loudly )
（大声喘息）

11:07.868 --> 11:17.110
( sobbing deeply )
（深深抽泣）

11:17.144 --> 11:18.812
SPONGE?
海绵？

11:18.846 --> 11:21.749
( wailing )
（哀号）

11:25.118 --> 11:26.887
ANOTHER ONE?
另一个？

11:26.920 --> 11:29.489
I TOLD YOUR LITTLE FRIEND,
I AIN'T PAYING FOR THAT.
我告诉你的小朋友，
我不为此付钱。

11:29.522 --> 11:32.259
WELL, THIS ONE'S ON THE HOUSE!
好吧，这个就在家里了！

11:32.292 --> 11:33.994
DID HE CHANGE
HIS MIND?
他改变了吗？
他的想法？

11:34.027 --> 11:35.963
HE SURE DID.
他确实做到了。

11:35.996 --> 11:37.865
ATE THE WHOLE THING
IN ONE BITE.
吃了整个东西
一口咬下去。

11:37.898 --> 11:38.866
NO DRINK?
不喝酒？

11:38.899 --> 11:40.000
NO.
不。

11:40.033 --> 11:40.868
NOW TAKE ME HOME.
现在带我回家。

11:40.901 --> 11:41.835
ARE YOU KIDDING?
你在开玩笑吧？

11:41.869 --> 11:43.136
WE HAVE
JUST ENOUGH TIME
我们有
时间刚刚好

11:43.170 --> 11:44.872
TO MAKE IT
BACK TO WORK.
做到这一点
返回工作岗位。

11:45.338 --> 11:46.506
( tires squeal )
（轮胎吱吱声）

11:46.539 --> 11:48.508
WORK?
工作？

11:48.541 --> 11:52.846
OH, MY ACHING TENTACLES!
哦，我疼痛的触手！

12:05.025 --> 12:09.096
All:
WALKING, WALKING, WALKING,
WALKING, WALKING, WALKING
全部：
步行，步行，步行，
步行，步行，步行

12:09.129 --> 12:11.398
WALKING, WALKING, WALKING,
WALKING, WALKING.
步行，步行，步行，
行走，行走。

12:12.265 --> 12:13.233
HUNGRY.
饥饿的。

12:13.266 --> 12:15.468
All:
HUNGRY, HUNGRY, HUNGRY...
全部：
饿了，饿了，饿了……

12:15.502 --> 12:17.270
HUNGRY, HUNGRY...
饿了，饿了……

12:17.304 --> 12:19.372
( chomping )
（咀嚼）

12:19.406 --> 12:20.407
STILL HUNGRY.
还是饿。

12:20.440 --> 12:22.109
All:
STILL HUNGRY, STILL HUNGRY
全部：
还饿，还饿

12:22.142 --> 12:23.844
STILL HUNGRY, STILL HUNGRY
还饿，还饿

12:23.877 --> 12:28.949
STILL HUNGRY, STILL HUNGRY,
STILL HUNGRY, STILL HUNGRY...
还饿，还饿，
还饿，还饿……

12:28.982 --> 12:30.317
( grinding )
（研磨）

12:30.350 --> 12:33.120
AW, DANG NEMATODES.
噢，该死的线虫。

12:33.153 --> 12:34.788
THIRSTY.
渴。

12:34.822 --> 12:38.091
All:
THIRSTY, THIRSTY, THIRSTY,
THIRSTY, THIRSTY, THIRSTY
全部：
口渴，口渴，口渴，
口渴，口渴，口渴

12:38.125 --> 12:41.061
THIRSTY, THIRSTY, THIRSTY,
THIRSTY, THIRSTY
口渴，口渴，口渴，
渴了，渴了

12:41.995 --> 12:45.899
( slurping )
（吸食）

12:45.933 --> 12:47.434
( snoring )
（打鼾）

12:47.467 --> 12:49.937
( nematodes still slurping )
（线虫仍在吸食）

12:53.473 --> 12:55.075
( meows )
（喵）

12:55.108 --> 12:56.944
( low-pitched blast )
（低沉的爆炸声）

12:56.977 --> 12:58.278
( medium-pitched blast )
（中等音调的爆炸声）

12:58.311 --> 12:59.847
( high-pitched blast )
（高亢的爆炸声）

13:03.984 --> 13:07.187
HURRAY, GARY,
WE'RE FINALLY HUGE!
万岁，加里，
我们终于变大了！

13:07.220 --> 13:08.188
( nematodes slurping )
（线虫吸食）

13:08.221 --> 13:09.589
( meows )
（喵）

13:09.622 --> 13:11.058
HUH? WAIT A MINUTE.
嗯？等一下。

13:11.091 --> 13:11.825
OH, NO!
哦，不！

13:11.859 --> 13:14.261
( nematodes slurping )
（线虫吸食）

13:14.294 --> 13:16.096
( groans )
（呻吟）

13:16.129 --> 13:17.197
( meows )
（喵）

13:17.931 --> 13:19.032
OW.
哦。

13:19.066 --> 13:20.167
SHELL PHONE!
手机壳！

13:20.200 --> 13:22.169
I'LL CALL SQUIDWARD.
我会打电话给章鱼哥。

13:22.202 --> 13:23.470
HE'LL KNOW WHAT TO DO.
他会知道该怎么做。

13:23.503 --> 13:24.537
Squidward:
Hello?
章鱼哥：
你好？

13:24.571 --> 13:25.505
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

13:25.538 --> 13:29.042
IS IT TIME ALREADY
FOR YOU TO RUIN MY DAY?
时间到了吗
让你毁了我的一天？

13:29.076 --> 13:30.443
SQUIDWARD, HELP ME!
章鱼哥，帮帮我！

13:30.477 --> 13:32.846
MY HOUSE IS GETTING SMALLER
AND SMALLER...
我的房子越来越小
还有更小的...

13:32.880 --> 13:35.015
( voice speeds up,
pitch gets higher )
（声音加快，
音高变高）

13:35.048 --> 13:37.017
( dial tone hums )
（拨号音嗡嗡声）

13:37.050 --> 13:38.385
Oh, no!
哦，不！

13:38.418 --> 13:39.953
YEP, IT IS.
是的，确实如此。

13:39.987 --> 13:42.355
( SpongeBob screaming )
（海绵宝宝尖叫）

13:42.389 --> 13:45.525
IS IT TIME ALREADY
TO RUIN SQUID'S DAY?
时间到了吗
破坏鱿鱼节？

13:45.558 --> 13:46.860
( cries out )
（大声喊叫）

13:46.894 --> 13:48.028
( loud thud )
（一声巨响）

13:48.061 --> 13:51.131
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
DON'T START WITHOUT ME.
嘿，海绵宝宝，
没有我就不要开始。

13:51.164 --> 13:56.069
( still slurping )
（还在咕噜咕噜）

13:56.103 --> 13:57.070
( burps )
（打嗝）

13:57.104 --> 13:59.039
( all burping )
（都打嗝了）

14:00.240 --> 14:02.009
( groans )
（呻吟）

14:02.042 --> 14:04.577
NEMATODES.
线虫。

14:05.645 --> 14:07.347
THE ONLY THING LEFT IN MY HOUSE
我家里唯一剩下的东西

14:07.380 --> 14:09.016
IS THIS LITTLE PEBBLE.
这是小卵石吗？

14:09.049 --> 14:11.418
WHAT'S GOING
ON HERE?
发生了什么
在这里？

14:11.451 --> 14:13.020
I'VE GOT
BAD NEWS, GUYS.
我有
坏消息，伙计们。

14:13.053 --> 14:15.122
LOOK AT WHAT HAPPENED
TO MY HOUSE!
看看发生了什么
到我家！

14:15.155 --> 14:15.956
IT'S GONE!
不见了！

14:15.989 --> 14:18.525
( crying ):
IT'S ALL GONE.
（哭）：
一切都消失了。

14:18.558 --> 14:21.094
WHAT AM I GOING TO DO?
我要做什么？

14:21.128 --> 14:22.329
WHERE AM I GOING TO LIVE?
我要住在哪里？

14:22.362 --> 14:24.998
YEAH.
是的。

14:25.032 --> 14:28.902
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
YOUR HOUSE IS GONE!
嘿，海绵宝宝，
你的房子没了！

14:28.936 --> 14:30.170
WELL, WHAT CAN I SAY?
好吧，我能说什么？

14:30.203 --> 14:32.472
IT'S BEEN GREAT
KNOWING YOU, SPONGEBOB.
太棒了
认识你，海绵宝宝。

14:32.505 --> 14:34.174
GOOD LUCK
SOMEWHERE ELSE.
祝你好运
其他地方。

14:34.207 --> 14:35.943
I'M GOING
TO MISS YOU.
我要去
想念你。

14:35.976 --> 14:37.978
BOO-HOO!
号泣！

14:38.011 --> 14:39.679
BOO-HOO,
BOO-HOO!
嘘呼，
嘘呼！

14:39.712 --> 14:43.050
( laughing raucously ):
BOO-HOO! BOO-HOO!
（沙哑地笑）：
嘘呼！号泣！

14:43.083 --> 14:45.518
SQUID'S TAKING IT
REAL HARD.
鱿鱼正在接受它
真的很难。

14:45.552 --> 14:47.387
WHAT ARE YOU
GOING TO DO NOW?
你是什么？
现在要做吗？

14:47.420 --> 14:51.158
I GUESS I'LL HAVE TO MOVE BACK
WITH MY MOM AND DAD.
我想我得回去了
和我爸爸妈妈一起。

14:52.225 --> 14:53.393
Patrick:
NO!
帕特里克：
不！

14:53.426 --> 14:55.929
WAIT A MINUTE-- NO, YOU DON'T.
等一下——不，你不需要。

14:56.629 --> 14:59.166
WE CAN BUILD YOU
A NEW HOUSE.
我们可以打造您
一座新房子。

14:59.199 --> 15:01.168
WE CAN'T BUILD A HOUSE!
我们无法建造房屋！

15:01.201 --> 15:03.036
WELL, SURE,
IT'S EASY.
嗯，当然，
这很容易。

15:03.070 --> 15:05.572
I BUILT MY HOUSE
ALL BY MYSELF.
我建造了我的房子
全靠我自己。

15:07.040 --> 15:10.577
ALL RIGHT, PATRICK,
LET'S GET TO WORK.
好吧，帕特里克，
让我们开始工作吧。

15:15.983 --> 15:17.450
OW!
噢！

15:17.484 --> 15:18.651
OW!
噢！

15:18.685 --> 15:20.253
OW!
噢！

15:28.228 --> 15:30.097
( groans )
（呻吟）

15:30.130 --> 15:33.166
( yelling )
（大喊）

15:34.434 --> 15:36.203
( yelling )
（大喊）

15:44.577 --> 15:46.279
OW!
噢！

15:47.514 --> 15:49.382
OW!
噢！

15:49.416 --> 15:51.218
OW!
噢！

15:51.251 --> 15:52.719
OW!
噢！

15:54.154 --> 15:55.088
WE'RE DONE!
我们完成了！

15:55.122 --> 15:56.123
YEAH!
是的！

15:56.156 --> 15:58.058
SO, WHAT DO
YOU THINK?
那么，该怎么办
你认为？

15:59.159 --> 16:00.527
Patrick:
I WISH I LIVED THERE.
帕特里克：
我希望我住在那里。

16:00.560 --> 16:02.162
REALLY?
真的吗？

16:02.195 --> 16:03.696
NO.
不。

16:06.099 --> 16:07.167
ONE BEDROOM.
一间卧室。

16:09.402 --> 16:11.438
TARTAR SAUCE.
鞑靼酱。

16:12.805 --> 16:16.143
WELL, LOOKS LIKE WE'VE GOT
TO MOVE BACK WITH MOM AND POP.
好吧，看起来我们已经有了
和妈妈爸爸一起搬回去。

16:16.176 --> 16:18.578
YOU CAN'T MOVE BACK IN
WITH YOUR PARENTS.
你不能搬回去
和你的父母一起。

16:18.611 --> 16:21.181
WHEN MY PARENTS
KICKED ME OUT
OF THE HOUSE
当我的父母
把我踢出去了
房子的

16:21.214 --> 16:22.215
I NEVER WENT BACK.
我再也没有回去过。

16:22.249 --> 16:23.316
WAIT!
等待！

16:23.350 --> 16:26.453
YOU AND GARY CAN COME STAY
WITH ME!
你和加里可以留下来
和我一起！

16:26.486 --> 16:28.188
THAT'D BE GREAT!
那太好了！

16:28.221 --> 16:31.058
YEAH, WE'LL BE
ROCKMATES!
是的，我们会的
岩友们！

16:31.091 --> 16:33.426
( crickets chirping )
（蟋蟀鸣叫）

16:33.460 --> 16:36.229
GOOD NIGHT, SPONGEBOB.
晚安，海绵宝宝。

16:36.663 --> 16:38.298
( moans )
（呻吟声）

16:38.331 --> 16:40.133
GOOD NIGHT, ROCKMATE.
晚安，摇滚伙伴。

16:40.167 --> 16:41.434
( meows )
（喵）

16:41.468 --> 16:42.469
GOOD NIGHT, GARY.
晚安，加里。

16:42.502 --> 16:48.475
( snoring )
（打鼾）

16:48.508 --> 16:49.676
( Patrick groans )
（帕特里克呻吟）

16:49.709 --> 16:52.645
NO... WHAT THE...
不...那是什么...

16:52.679 --> 16:54.647
( snoring lightly )
（轻微的鼾声）

16:54.681 --> 16:57.184
( groans loudly )
（大声呻吟）

16:57.217 --> 16:59.286
( snores lightly )
（轻轻打鼾）

16:59.319 --> 17:01.388
( groans loudly )
（大声呻吟）

17:01.421 --> 17:04.257
( groans loudly )
（大声呻吟）

17:04.291 --> 17:05.525
( teeth chattering )
（牙齿打颤）

17:06.293 --> 17:08.761
( groaning )
（呻吟）

17:12.165 --> 17:14.534
( snoring )
（打鼾）

17:14.567 --> 17:18.105
( snorting )
（哼哼）

17:18.138 --> 17:21.174
( groans )
（呻吟）

17:21.208 --> 17:22.475
( wind howling )
（风呼啸）

17:22.509 --> 17:25.145
( teeth chattering )
（牙齿打颤）

17:25.178 --> 17:26.646
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

17:26.679 --> 17:29.282
( sighs )
（叹气）

17:29.316 --> 17:31.351
( snoring )
（打鼾）

17:31.384 --> 17:32.352
( shivering )
（发抖）

17:32.385 --> 17:34.721
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

17:34.754 --> 17:37.290
( shivering )
（发抖）

17:37.324 --> 17:39.626
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

17:39.659 --> 17:40.827
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

17:40.860 --> 17:41.861
( shivering )
（发抖）

17:41.894 --> 17:44.131
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

17:44.164 --> 17:45.165
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

17:45.198 --> 17:50.270
( both grunting )
（两人都咕哝着）

17:50.303 --> 17:52.239
( grunting )
（咕哝）

17:52.872 --> 17:56.509
( shivering )
（发抖）

17:56.543 --> 18:00.113
( snoring )
（打鼾）

18:00.147 --> 18:03.216
( gurgling )
（咕噜声）

18:03.250 --> 18:04.317
( snoring )
（打鼾）

18:04.351 --> 18:05.552
( hooting )
（鸣叫）

18:05.585 --> 18:06.619
( snores )
（打鼾）

18:06.653 --> 18:09.088
( hoots )
（叫声）

18:10.223 --> 18:15.828
( gurgling )
（咕噜声）

18:23.870 --> 18:29.376
( gurgling )
（咕噜声）

18:31.711 --> 18:34.447
( muffled snoring )
（低沉的鼾声）

18:39.786 --> 18:42.755
( grumbling )
（抱怨）

18:42.789 --> 18:45.825
( groaning )
（呻吟）

18:50.863 --> 18:52.732
( rumbling )
（隆隆声）

18:52.765 --> 18:53.866
( coughs )
（咳嗽）

18:53.900 --> 18:57.170
OH! SPIDERS! SPIDERS!
哦！蜘蛛！蜘蛛！

18:57.204 --> 18:58.571
GET THEM OFF ME!
把他们从我身上拿开！

18:58.605 --> 19:00.940
NO, PATRICK, NO,
PATRICK, NO!
不，帕特里克，不，
帕特里克，不！

19:00.973 --> 19:02.342
IT'S ME!
这就是我！

19:02.375 --> 19:04.777
I'M SPONGEBOB!
我是海绵宝宝！

19:04.811 --> 19:06.279
( gasps )
（喘气）

19:06.313 --> 19:09.549
( sighing )
（叹气）

19:11.518 --> 19:13.520
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

19:13.553 --> 19:15.488
( Patrick sighs )
（帕特里克叹了口气）

19:15.522 --> 19:17.390
( shivering )
（发抖）

19:22.529 --> 19:24.197
SPIDER!
蜘蛛！

19:24.231 --> 19:25.965
SPIDER, SPIDER!
蜘蛛，蜘蛛！

19:25.998 --> 19:27.300
OW! OW!
噢！噢！

19:27.334 --> 19:29.769
NO! NO! STOP! NO!
不！不！停止！不！

19:35.408 --> 19:37.844
( whispering ):
SQUIDWARD.
（窃窃私语）：
章鱼哥。

19:37.877 --> 19:39.612
SQUIDWARD.
章鱼哥。

19:39.646 --> 19:40.513
( mumbling )
（咕哝）

19:40.547 --> 19:42.415
( in normal voice ):
SQUIDWARD.
（正常语气）：
章鱼哥。

19:42.449 --> 19:43.450
OH... WHAT?
哦...什么？

19:43.483 --> 19:45.352
COULD WE STAY HERE
A COUPLE OF DAYS
我们可以留在这里吗
几天

19:45.385 --> 19:46.353
OR A MONTH OR TWO?
还是一两个月？

19:46.386 --> 19:49.289
MMM... YEAH, WELL, WHATEVER.
嗯...是的，好吧，无论如何。

19:49.322 --> 19:49.989
THANKS.
谢谢。

19:50.022 --> 19:51.358
OH, SURE...
哦，当然...

19:51.391 --> 19:53.260
THANKS, SQUIDWARD.
谢谢，章鱼哥。

19:53.293 --> 19:55.662
SQUIDWARD, CAN YOU
SCOOT OVER A LITTLE?
章鱼哥，你可以吗
稍微移动一下？

19:55.695 --> 19:57.397
OH, YEAH, SURE,
MM-HMM...
哦，是的，当然，
嗯嗯……

19:57.430 --> 19:58.898
OH, WHILE YOU'RE AT IT
哦，当你在的时候

19:58.931 --> 20:01.368
COULD YOU GET ME
A GLASS OF WATER?
你能找到我吗
一杯水？

20:01.401 --> 20:02.902
OKAY... YEAH, SURE...
好的...是的，当然...

20:02.935 --> 20:04.437
THIS IS A REAL
SWELL PLACE.
这是真实的
好地方。

20:04.471 --> 20:05.438
THANKS, BUDDY.
谢谢，伙计。

20:05.472 --> 20:07.940
YOU'RE WELCOME.
不客气。

20:07.974 --> 20:10.410
YEAH, I LIKE
SLEEP-OVERS.
是的，我喜欢
过夜。

20:10.443 --> 20:12.812
YEAH, ME, TOO.
是的，我也是。

20:12.845 --> 20:14.514
YEP, THIS IS GREAT.
是的，这太棒了。

20:14.547 --> 20:16.516
GOOD NIGHT, SQUIDWARD.
晚安，章鱼哥。

20:16.549 --> 20:19.886
( yawning ):
GOOD NIGHT, SPONGEBOB.
（打哈欠）：
晚安，海绵宝宝。

20:23.956 --> 20:26.726
( firmly ):
GOOD NIGHT, SPONGEBOB.
（坚决）：
晚安，海绵宝宝。

20:30.863 --> 20:33.533
( rooster crows, seagulls call )
（公鸡报晓，海鸥鸣叫）

20:36.569 --> 20:37.537
TA-TA-DUM!
塔塔杜姆！

20:37.570 --> 20:39.772
TODAY'S THE BIG DAY, SQUIDWARD!
今天是大日子，章鱼哥！

20:39.806 --> 20:41.674
DON'T WANT TO BE LATE!
不想迟到！

20:41.708 --> 20:44.010
GOT TO HURRY!
一定要快点！

20:44.877 --> 20:46.879
HOLD IT! HOLD EVERYTHING!
坚持住！持有一切！

20:48.014 --> 20:50.517
I WOULD NOT WANT TO MISS THIS--
我不想错过这个——

20:50.550 --> 20:53.953
THE DAY SPONGEBOB MOVES!
海绵宝宝动起来的日子！

20:53.986 --> 20:57.457
I CAN'T BELIEVE
IT'S REALLY HAPPENING.
我不敢相信
这真的发生了。

20:57.490 --> 21:00.026
DON'T WORRY, SQUIDWARD,
I'LL COME VISIT YOU.
别担心，章鱼哥，
我会来看你。

21:00.059 --> 21:03.630
DON'T TRY TO CHEER ME UP,
SPONGEBOB... PLEASE.
别试图让我高兴起来，
海绵宝宝...求你了。

21:03.663 --> 21:04.897
( car approaching )
（汽车驶近）

21:04.931 --> 21:05.998
HERE COME MY PARENTS.
我的父母来了。

21:06.032 --> 21:07.634
( bawling )
（嚎啕大哭）

21:07.667 --> 21:09.936
Mom:
SPONGEBOB, HI, HONEY.
妈妈：
海绵宝宝，嗨，亲爱的。

21:09.969 --> 21:11.070
WE'RE HERE!
我们在这里！

21:11.103 --> 21:12.572
COME ON,
SPONGEBOB.
来吧，
海绵宝宝。

21:12.605 --> 21:13.540
HURRY, HURRY, SON.
快点，快点，儿子。

21:13.573 --> 21:15.708
YOUR MOTHER HAS
DINNER WAITING.
你妈妈有
晚餐等待。

21:15.742 --> 21:16.709
HI, MOM.
嗨，妈妈。

21:16.743 --> 21:18.010
HELLO, MRS. SQUAREPANTS.
你好，夫人。方裤。

21:18.044 --> 21:19.045
LET ME HELP YOU
让我帮助你

21:19.078 --> 21:20.012
WITH THESE BAGS.
带着这些袋子。

21:20.046 --> 21:21.414
JUST GIVE ME A MINUTE.
请给我一分钟。

21:21.448 --> 21:23.416
( Patrick crying in background )
（帕特里克在后台哭泣）

21:23.450 --> 21:26.519
I CANNOT HOLD ON TO YOU
ANY LONGER, LITTLE PEBBLE.
我无法抓住你
更长一点的小卵石。

21:35.562 --> 21:38.465
YOU HOLD TOO MANY MEMORIES.
你拥有太多的回忆。

21:38.498 --> 21:39.966
( crying )
（哭）

21:39.999 --> 21:41.434
( sniffles )
（抽鼻子）

21:46.072 --> 21:48.808
WELL, SQUIDWARD,
THIS IS GOOD-BYE.
嗯，章鱼哥，
再见了。

21:48.841 --> 21:51.878
GOOD-BYE, SPONGEBOB,
GOOD-BYE.
再见，海绵宝宝，
再见。

21:51.911 --> 21:53.946
* GOOD-BYE, SPONGEBOB,
BYE-BYE-BYE *
* 再见，海绵宝宝，
再见，再见*

21:53.980 --> 21:55.648
* GOOD-BYE, SPONGEBOB
* 再见，海绵宝宝

21:55.682 --> 21:57.016
HA, HA, GOOD-BYE, GOOD-BYE.
哈，哈，再见，再见。

21:57.049 --> 21:58.585
( crying )
（哭）

21:58.618 --> 21:59.752
Mom:
COME ON, SPONGEBOB.
妈妈：
来吧，海绵宝宝。

21:59.786 --> 22:00.720
GOOD-BYE, PATRICK.
再见，帕特里克。

22:00.753 --> 22:04.457
GOOD-BYE,
BIKINI BOTTOM.
再见，
比基尼下装。

22:04.491 --> 22:05.758
( all cry out )
（大家都哭了）

22:05.792 --> 22:08.361
( crying hysterically )
（歇斯底里地哭）

22:08.395 --> 22:11.063
* SPONGEBOB IS LEAVING,
HE'S LEAVING, HE'S LEAVING... *
* 海绵宝宝要离开，
他要走了，他要走了……*

22:12.399 --> 22:14.634
* LA, LA, LA, LA,
LA, LA, HA, HA! *
* 洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶，洛杉矶，
洛杉矶，洛杉矶，哈，哈！ *

22:15.502 --> 22:16.703
YEAH, BABY! HA, HA!
是的，宝贝！哈，哈！

22:19.138 --> 22:21.508
* SPONGEBOB IS LEAVING,
HE'S LEAVING... *
* 海绵宝宝要离开，
他要离开... *

22:21.541 --> 22:28.681
( loud rumbling )
（隆隆声）

22:34.854 --> 22:37.356
MY HOUSE IS BACK!
我的房子回来了！

22:38.958 --> 22:40.627
OH, GOOD OLD PINEAPPLE
哦，好老菠萝

22:40.660 --> 22:43.430
GETTING SOURER
THAN IT USED TO BE.
越来越酸
比以前更好了。

22:43.463 --> 22:47.400
( all exclaiming )
（大家惊呼）

22:47.434 --> 22:50.603
AW, SQUIDWARD,
ISN'T THIS GREAT?!
噢，章鱼哥，
这不是很棒吗？

22:50.637 --> 22:52.539
I'M BACK FOREVER!
我永远回来了！

22:52.572 --> 22:54.707
( mumbling ):
FOREVER?
（咕哝）：
永远？

22:59.746 --> 23:02.649
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

